==Belarusian==

===Etymology===
A nursery word. From {{cog|sla-pro|*mama}}, from {{cog|ine-bsl-pro|*mā́ˀmāˀ}}, from {{cog|ine-pro|*méh₂-méh₂}}, a reduplication of {{m|ine-pro|*méh₂-}} - the root of {{m|ine-pro|*méh₂tēr||mother}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|Muhme|t=aunt}}, {{cog|la|mamma|t=mother, nurse}}, {{cog|ga|mam|t=mother}}, {{cog|lt|mama}}, {{m|lt|moma|t=mother}} among others. Cf. {{cog|sla-pro|*tata}}, {{m|sla-pro|*baba}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{be-IPA|ма́ма}}

===Noun===
{{be-noun|ма́ма<pr>}}

# [[mum]] / [[mom]]

====Declension====
{{be-ndecl|ма́ма<pr>}}

===References===
* {{R:be:slounik.org}}

{{topics|be|Female family members}}

